More particularly,

	nethack -u DrNo
	nethack -u Indy
	nethack -u Pteppic

will start you with that name, and your savegames will end up named
with <UID>Name ; you can keep multiple games in progress that way.
If you can remember the exact sequence of arguments, then

	nethack -u DrNo-Gno-Hea-Mal-Neu

will start you off just the way you want, and this is the basis
for several scripts that do things like "I want a random character
of a class I haven't ascended yet" (for me, HCBA).


